      "default": "Our upholstery materials are developed in-house to strike the perfect balance between tactile comfort and long-term durability. By sourcing premium leatherette and fabrics from around the world, we studied the most desirable qualities of each to craft upholstery that meets — and often exceeds — the standards of today’s best gaming chairs."
